WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.970
Zero Trust avoids implicit trust and evaluates access using current identity, device,

00:00:04.970 --> 00:00:07.235
resource, policy, and risk context.

00:00:07.235 --> 00:00:11.000
Identity assurance, device posture, least privilege, visibility, monitoring,

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:13.000
and resource-focused policy work together.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:17.685
Zero Trust is an organizational security strategy rather than a single technology product

00:00:17.685 --> 00:00:19.000
or one-time project.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:23.020
Successful journeys prioritize important risks, integrate capabilities, govern exceptions,

00:00:23.020 --> 00:00:25.760
measure progress, and continuously improve.
